        <mxCell id="jeDy7UZnUh1UGIpTU1VL-9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div&gt;Data Modelling and Consistency&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;2 users should not be able to book same property&lt;br&gt;Methods&lt;br&gt;Pessimistic locking - lock on read, not scalable, slow&lt;br&gt;Optimistic locking - check version before upsert, scalable ** choose&lt;br&gt;2Phase commit (distributed systems)&lt;br&gt;Use DB constraint/trigger - eg: total booking &amp;gt; avaiable rooms&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DB Choice&lt;br&gt;Property - Relational DB as source -&amp;gt; CDC -&amp;gt; Elastisearch to facilitate search. Redis for fast response&lt;br&gt;Users - CIAM(SQL/ No SQLDB)&lt;br&gt;Bookings - Relational cached&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
